 class=\"mjx-c1D412 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2217\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>∗</mo></mrow></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> and its eigenvalues, the\neigenvalues of <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{S}\\mathbf{S}^{*}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D412 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-msup><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D412 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2217\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi></mrow><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>∗</mo></mrow></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, and the\nfactors <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\theta_1, \\theta_2\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D703 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D703 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> of <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"thm-ostrowski-relative\">@thm-ostrowski-relative</span>.\nHence verify the theorem for this pair.</p>","file":"ch20-perturbation/06-hermitian-perturbations.html"}